that the generator for the Spring Forest building is overheating and will lose power in the next 5 minutes. The engineer has just enough time to run to a switching station to replace the failing generators with power destined for the East Valley building.\n<br><br>\n\n\nIf the electrical engineer has a friend in the Spring Forest building, is it morally acceptable to switch the electrical supply from the East Valley building to the Spring Forest building instead? This would kill the 1250 patients in the East Valley building but save the 500 patients in the Spring Forest building?\n\n\n","QuestionID":"QID617"}},
