{"SurveyID":"SV_eQbYkLxGIFmBefQ","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID451","SecondaryAttribute":"Zoklid Plague While using drones to monitor the army of emperor Kheogezia conquering another coun...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<b>Zoklid Plague<\/b><br><br>\n\n\nWhile using drones to monitor the army of emperor Kheogezia conquering another country, an air force officer sees that the emperor has released two Zoklid swarms to destroy the crops of the enemy population.<br>\nZoklids are dangerous insects. If nothing is done, the Zoklid swarms will reach the settlements of Onpahis and Nova Mistral respectively, destroying their crops. The officer can send a drone to release pesticides over one of the swarms, though the quantity of pesticide needed will affect the area underneath which is occupied by another field of crops. The crops exposed to the pesticide will make them toxic and inedible. This leaves the officer with two options:\n<br><br>\n\n<ul>\n\n<li>\n<i>Option1<\/i>:\nRelease pesticides over the swarm headed for Nova Mistral. This would destroy 1 acre of crops underneath but save 5 acres of crops in Nova Mistral.\n\n<\/li>\n\n<li>\n<i>Option2<\/i>:\nRelease pesticides over the swarm headed for Onaphis. This would destroy 2 acres of crops underneath but save 40 acres of crops in Onaphis.\n\n<\/li>\n\n<\/ul><br<br><br>\n\n\nIf you were faced with this choice, would you choose option 1 or option 2?\n<br><br>\n\n","DataExportTag":"scenario.plagueZoklid.econ.comparisonType.ratio_vs_victims.n_saved1.40.n_saved2.5.n_total1.42.n_total2.6.n_victims1.2.n_victims2.1.high_ratio_second","QuestionID":"QID451","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAHR","SubSelector":"TX","QuestionDescription":"Zoklid Plague While using drones to monitor the army of emperor Kheogezia conquering another coun...","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"1: Definitely Option 1"},"2":{"Display":"2"},"3":{"Display":"3"},"4":{"Display":"4"},"5":{"Display":"5"},"6":{"Display":"6: Definitely Optio